                <pb facs="1091" n="971" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg971"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Chargé
                    Hutchinson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-11-21"><hi rendition="#italic">November 21,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hutchinson is instructed to immediately use his strenuous good offices with
                    the Venezuelan Government to speed the prompt, impartial, and final trial and
                    decision of the asphalt case.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
